@startuml
!include common-style.puml

title Software Development Process\n4N Clinic Management System

skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #334155
  FontColor #111827
  FontSize 13
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FDE68A
  DiamondBorderColor #92400E
  StartColor #0F766E
  EndColor #0F766E
}

start

:1. Requirements Survey;
note right
Stakeholders:
- Clinic owner / Manager
- Receptionist (Le tan)
- Doctor (Bac si)
- Cashier (Thu ngan)
- Admin
- Nurse / Lab Tech / Pharmacist
end note

:2. Requirements Specification;
note right
Outputs:
- Functional requirements
- Non-functional requirements
- Business rules (BR-01 to BR-29)
- Use cases (Phase 1: 18 UC / Phase 2: 17 UC)
- Acceptance criteria
end note

:3. System Design;
note right
Outputs:
- System context diagram
- Container diagram (C4 Level 2)
- Backend component map
- Auth / RBAC architecture
end note

:4. Software Design;
note right
Outputs:
- Database schema (37 models, 12 enums)
- API design (92 endpoints / api/v1)
- Sequence diagrams
- UI/UX design (clinic palette)
- State machine definitions
end note

:5. Implementation;
note right
Stack:
- Backend: NestJS + Prisma + PostgreSQL
- Frontend: React + Vite + Tailwind
- Auth: JWT stateless
- Version control: Git
- Module-based development
end note

:6. Testing;
note right
Coverage:
- E2E tests Phase 1: 104 tests (3 suites)
- Manual UI tests: checklist per screen
- Phase 2: manual + regression
end note

:7. Deployment & Operation;
note right
Current scope:
- Local / development environment
- Database migrations (3 files)
- Seed data (8 demo accounts)
- Swagger at /api/docs
- Prisma Studio for data inspection
end note

stop

legend bottom
Process follows: Specification -> Design -> Implementation -> Validation -> Evolution.
endlegend

@enduml
